# Cross-CLI review scratch — engine sandboxes refuse to write outside the working
# directory, so review output lands here rather than in a temp folder.
/.review-out/

# Junction to the EV3 reference collection (firmware source, LEGO's own decompiled tools,
# the official developer kits). It lives outside the repo; the junction exists because
# review engines sandbox themselves to the working directory and refuse a `..` path.
# Never commit it — it is a large third-party corpus, not ours to redistribute.
/ev3-resources

